# SHA-256 of the keycloak.v2 login templates our theme copies, as shipped in Keycloak 26.8.1
# (org.keycloak.keycloak-themes jar). A test compares them with the Keycloak the tests run; when one
# changes on an upgrade, merge Keycloak's change into our copy, then update the hash and the version here.
# Only keycloak.v2 login copies belong here; a copy of a base-only page or a template of our own needs the tests
# (KeycloakRealmTests, KeycloakVersionTests) extended first.
